MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

I patched Stan so that the output order for derived
params matches those for params.  The order I gave
last time was right, but it's row-major, not column
major.  So if we have a[2,2,2] the output order is

   a[1,1,1], a[1,1,2], a[1,2,1], a[1,2,2],
   a[2,1,1], a[2,1,2], a[2,2,1], a[2,2,2].

- Bob

On 1/2/12 1:29 PM, Jiqiang Guo wrote:

> In vol 2 example alli, we have arrays of parameters.  Currently, the
> arrays of parameters were dumped in different order for parameters
> from for derived parameters.
>
> --
> Jiqiang
