Subject: implementing multiple methods in stan/nuts
Message-ID: <0EhY4KKtgSk.QBo1uzF4IJYJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/0EhY4KKtgSk/m/QBo1uzF4IJYJ>
