From u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com  Tue Jan 17 19:34:25 2012
From: u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com (Ben Goodrich)
Date: Tue, 17 Jan 2012 19:34:25 +0000
Subject: Proposal for ColVector, etc.
Message-ID: <RjAkN7LlAK4.KvvRxxU4QV0J@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
