Note that my point wasn't that you aren't guaranteed a joint model by writing the product of conditionals, it was that taking a product of conditionals does not give you the joint to which those conditionals correspond.

I'm not saying that the model in pineapple_ice.stan isn't a valid model, I'm saying that it's not equivalent to the model in ice.stan, or to the model as it's interpreted by BUGS, and so we shouldn't expect it to produce the same results. Because it's a different model.

Matt

