This is an example supported by OpenBUGS but NOT JAGS.  So
what BUGS really supports is beyond what Lunn et al says in the
paper, but I could not find the document.

## (x1, x2)' ~ mutil_normal with
## mean (0, 0)
## var  ( 100, 24 )
##       ( 24,    9  )
model {
    x1 ~ dnorm(mu1, tau1);
    x2 ~ dnorm(mu2, tau2);
    mu1 <- 8 * x2 / 3;
    mu2 <- .24 * x1;
    tau1 <- 1 / 36;
    tau2 <- 1 / 3.24;
}

