Subject: Re: improper precision priors; symmetry of mu and y in normal errors
Message-ID: <Imvk_PRaa5c.cZKvpynFrxkJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Imvk_PRaa5c.ZtiSjNaNcXoJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
